## Database Configuration

### Databases to Create

{%- set valid_orders = ['<domain>_<env>_<dataproduct>', '<domain>_<dataproduct>_<env>', '<env>_<domain>_<dataproduct>'] %}
{%- set order = object_component_order if object_component_order is defined and object_component_order in valid_orders else '<domain>_<dataproduct>_<env>' %}
{%- set strategy = account_strategy if account_strategy is defined else 'Single Account' %}
{%- set parts = [] %}
{%- for component in order.split('_') %}
{%- set token = component[1:-1] %}
{%- if token == 'domain' and strategy not in ['Multi-Account (Domain-based)', 'Multi-Account (Domain + Environment)'] %}{%- if parts.append(data_product_domain | upper) %}{% endif %}
{%- elif token == 'env' and strategy not in ['Multi-Account (Environment-based)', 'Multi-Account (Domain + Environment)'] %}{%- if parts.append(data_product_environment | upper) %}{% endif %}
{%- elif token == 'dataproduct' %}{%- if parts.append(data_product_name | upper) %}{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
{%- set prefix = parts | join('_') %}

| Zone | Database Name | Time Travel | Database Roles |
|------|---------------|-------------|----------------|
{%- for zone in data_zones %}
| {{ zone.name | upper }} | `{{ prefix }}_{{ zone.name | upper }}` | {{ zone.time_travel_days }} days | DB_R, DB_W, DB_C |
{%- endfor %}

### Database Role Hierarchy

Each database will have three database roles:

```
{{ prefix }}_<ZONE>
├── DB_R (Database Read)
│   └── Inherits: All SC_R_* schema roles
├── DB_W (Database Write)
│   └── Inherits: DB_R + All SC_W_* schema roles
└── DB_C (Database Create)
    └── Inherits: DB_W + All SC_C_* schema roles
```

### Role Ownership

| Object | Owner |
|--------|-------|
| Database | `{{ prefix }}_ADMIN` |
| Database Roles (DB_R, DB_W, DB_C) | `{{ prefix }}_RBAC` |

### Account Role → Database Role Mapping

| Account Role | Receives | From All Databases |
|--------------|----------|-------------------|
| `{{ prefix }}_READ` | `DB_R` | Read access to all zones |
| `{{ prefix }}_WRITE` | `DB_W` | Write access to all zones |
| `{{ prefix }}_CREATE` | `DB_C` | Create access to all zones |

### Tags Applied

Each database will be tagged with:

| Tag | Value |
|-----|-------|
| `DOMAIN` | `{{ data_product_domain | upper }}` |
| `ENVIRONMENT` | `{{ data_product_environment | upper }}` |
| `DATAPRODUCT` | `{{ data_product_name | upper }}` |
| `ZONE` | `<zone_name>` |
{%- set account_strategy = account_strategy if account_strategy is defined else 'Single Account' %}
